{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3ab9632d57cb07710a8bf6772a58fdcc197c7d6544f421373a88230d168071",
      "text": "本次企划的宣传活动主题是\n“用照片留下珍贵的回忆”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f7ae6c98b2d03370121abcf1c26c554c2c404c24323beb6910de0a038df24bc",
      "text": "我们希望两位能用这款新相机的样机去拍些照片，\n并以此作为广告素材来使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:629237e675956e5a2509d7e6e4faa9d31da4a8d550935170b212e6b84b31ed0c",
      "text": "身边的喜欢的事物、珍视的人、风景，或是触动\n内心的东西等等，希望二位能自由地去拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eea3ac7fd349290ee9c1422c07106248d0fc83ddbebcae23aa33509bdb82d84",
      "text": "新产品的相机，一共有两款类型呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5347794ee5c13877664f6578bd7199c24ed149173ae9ee8074ba694f6c383e4c",
      "text": "喔喔！两款都帅呆了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a8c620f390f9b1f6870dcc6b96d2ba22aaaab9fb9eae407a1e0ee8116786ef",
      "text": "啊啊。连颜色，都简直像是为我们量身定做的一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:155cb6521120542537e389f378d393d8055b537b7ee5f9489653f97554a39a39",
      "text": "非常感谢！我们也是根据两位的形象特点，\n特意准备了这个颜色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d17c8214d1c5b9d27f575dd8c7bec38062b5d9d0314ac559a0913979abd80fd",
      "text": "这款相机的卖点就是操作便捷。使用方法\n非常简单，只要按下电源开关，就能立刻拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6cf2ee397734c6c02f75e80f71308429c62a17b0a206a4509e6db29be426e7",
      "text": "请试着操作看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792f23d8ec08b3af9e5fd5c4aab91f9626157456919c98163dab08d42ab3bfb6",
      "text": "噢，按下电源……哦，亮了。\n好，喵子，稍微往这边看一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9436093c0f2f6376096dab7ae8175961cde9770716d8e9b32195d483f106d77",
      "text": "拍得很棒嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62da91da543db5dd976c4a9eef3afc0732304189a24ac24d3df8f168df526d2c",
      "text": "拍身边亲近的伙伴或者家人的照片也很不错呢！\n如果可以的话，那种照片也拜托二位了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a40892c1e9acda16ba91fc821de515d11127522559fbe950338ca6e4fc4f5aa",
      "text": "家人啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98e43d1005fcffb54bf1fe73528ab08fed70dcbefaaa35a10438b3934f658ead",
      "text": "（老爹和老妈的照片吗。唔——……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9465e7cd5cd0563e68de264bb4f85f75dd98147a8fe40eb9b754c5646998952a",
      "text": "（……等等。玄武是一个人住的吧。\n他能拍家人的照片吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
